      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I don't have a \"not a bug\" status, but that's how this would be marked.\n\nIf either the Trigger components or the GameObject are disabled, they cannot receive actions. The fact that they could in previous releases was a bug.\n\nWe're still evaluating this, but for the time being this is now considered intended behavior.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
