      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: Maybe the VRC_Trigger component has been optimized now, but in the past, there was a real benefit to disabling the VRC_Trigger component since it had a lot of performance overhead in its update loop.\n\nIf you have some ~500 objects that have VRC_Triggers that are only ever triggered via ActivateCustomTrigger, there is a noticeable performance difference between whether those components are enabled and disabled.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
